      "message": "To me, this paragraph means that if a Device A is plugged in and claims CDP port, the Device B is plugged in, then Device A is unplugged, Device B is unable to claim CDP. Similarly, if Device C is plugged in, Device C couldn\u0027t claim the CDP port either.\n\nIs this the case? Is there a technical reason why we can\u0027t reallocate the CDP port once it is vacated (either to an existing device or worst case to a new device?)",
